      "props": {
        "aboutHeading": "A Legacy of Unparalleled Excellence",
        "aboutContent": "Since 1891, The Pemberton Grand has stood as a beacon of refined hospitality in London's most coveted address. What began as a private residence for the Earl of Pemberton has been lovingly transformed into an intimate retreat for couples seeking extraordinary moments.\n\nEvery corner of our hotel whispers stories of the past—hand-carved mahogany banisters, original oil paintings, and crystal chandeliers that have witnessed over a century of romance. Yet beneath this heritage lies a commitment to contemporary excellence: Egyptian cotton sheets with thread counts that invite endless mornings, bathrooms clad in Italian marble, and a concierge team who anticipates your desires before you voice them.\n\nOur philosophy is simple: luxury lies not in opulence alone, but in the curation of experiences that linger in memory. Whether it's champagne delivered to your suite as the sun sets over Hyde Park, a private after-hours tour of the National Gallery, or simply the perfect cup of Earl Grey prepared exactly as you prefer—excellence is in every detail.",
        "aboutImage": "https://cdn.example.com/the-pemberton-grand-about-1.webp",
